109
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:22,920
Prepare to die.

110
00:08:24,900 --> 00:08:34,280
Blessdale leader to all platoons.

111
00:08:34,400 --> 00:08:34,960
Move out.

112
00:08:35,260 --> 00:08:36,560
To the south bank now.

113
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:37,660
