114
00:08:39,420 --> 00:08:40,880
You waste your time.

115
00:08:42,780 --> 00:08:44,100
Fire, fire, fire!

116
00:08:44,340 --> 00:08:46,140
Get his attention focused on us.

117
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:47,140
And don't get hit.

118
00:08:47,780 --> 00:08:50,860
How are we going to keep his attention and not get ourselves shot to pieces?

119
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:52,300
Where is now?

120
00:08:52,300 --> 00:09:00,800
All right, we're here.

121
00:09:01,020 --> 00:09:01,800
Be careful now.

122
00:09:11,800 --> 00:09:12,640
I'm here.

123
00:09:12,640 --> 00:09:14,220
Okay, I'm patching you in.

124
