148
00:09:55,700 --> 00:10:01,740
Oh, that was close.

149
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:05,620
The effect of a beam weapon is that it can only travel in a straight line.

150
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:08,540
If we're below the curvature of the Earth, we should be safe.

151
00:10:08,740 --> 00:10:13,260
On the other hand, since our artillery shells follow a parabola due to Earth's gravity,

152
00:10:13,780 --> 00:10:16,000
