153
00:10:16,540 --> 00:10:18,400
As long as we can locate the target.

154
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:19,740
Correct by...

155
00:10:19,740 --> 00:10:20,420
283.

156
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:21,940
Minus 472.

157
00:10:21,940 --> 00:10:23,040
High-speed rounds!

158
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:23,900
