That's great news.

193
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:01,080
No, it's not.

194
00:12:01,660 --> 00:12:03,680
I told you to get yourself clear.

195
00:12:04,060 --> 00:12:06,080
You disobeyed an order, Warrant Officer.

196
00:12:06,580 --> 00:12:10,080
Hey, don't even think you're superior to me just because of your higher rank.

197
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,700
I am your superior.

198
00:12:12,120 --> 00:12:15,020
Big sisters aren't allowed to be ordered around by their little brothers.

199
00:12:15,020 --> 00:12:20,620
Clisdale leader to all platoons.

200
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,040
Mission complete.

201
00:12:22,560 --> 00:12:23,520
Let's return to base.

